    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="68.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 68.1a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forðamðe we magon witan fulgeorne, þæt se unmaga ⁊ se mage ne mæg gelice mycele byrðene aberan, ne se unhala ðam halan gelice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Because we may know full well that the weak and the strong cannot bear an equally heavy burden, nor can the sick man bear one equal to that borne by him who is sound.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">forþamðe ne mæg se unmaga þam magan, we witon fullgeorne, gelice byrðene ahebban, ne se unhala þam halan gelice.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
